# tally 2.1.8 item 77 (#201), E §4.1 step 2 and L §4.4: a test of a window-dated movement that comes out one way on
# some of its days and another on the rest is the window's hole, as far as the refusal or the other class would reach.
# The reach: out's sign-rule hole at jar holds up to jar's next reading, on 04-15, and ends there (r3, r4: 80.00 PLN,
# the anchor's difference the hole). 2.1.7's refcore: 50.00 PLN before the reading, a difference of 30.00 PLN at it.
# The plan's c5s with a reading of jar in April.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-05-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind savings: place PLN min 0
place jar: savings lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input wd: date
input dd: date

move out: transfers
  on wd
  leg cash from jar to world amount amt

move inn: transfers
  on dd
  leg cash from world to jar amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  anchor jar
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  wd = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) "s"
  dd = 2026-03-07 "s"
  opening[jar] = 50.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[jar] = 80.00 PLN at 2026-04-15 end "s"

ask r1: bal(jar, 2026-03-31)
ask r2: bal(jar, 2026-04-14)
ask r3: bal(jar, 2026-04-30)
ask r4: bal(jar, 2026-04-30) windows each
=== expect
r1: ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) not precise enough for a balance" (out)
  unfulfilled: inn
  unfulfilled: out
  cut 2026-05-01
r2: ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) not precise enough for a balance" (out)
  unfulfilled: inn
  unfulfilled: out
  cut 2026-05-01
r3: 80.00 PLN
  anchor: jar 2026-04-15 end, stated 80.00 PLN, difference ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) not precise enough for a balance" (out)
  cut 2026-05-01
r4 [wd = 2026-03-05]: 80.00 PLN
  anchor: jar 2026-04-15 end, stated 80.00 PLN, difference refused: RUN-PLACE jar is -50.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-05
  cut 2026-05-01
r4 [wd = 2026-03-06]: 80.00 PLN
  anchor: jar 2026-04-15 end, stated 80.00 PLN, difference refused: RUN-PLACE jar is -50.00 PLN after the day's observations and plans of 2026-03-06
  cut 2026-05-01
r4 [wd = 2026-03-07 .. 2026-03-10]: 80.00 PLN
  anchor: jar 2026-04-15 end, stated 80.00 PLN, difference 30.00 PLN
  cut 2026-05-01
